# 🛒 X-Store

Tienda de recargas de juegos y monedas virtuales.

## Stack
- Frontend: HTML + Tailwind CDN + JS vanilla
- Backend: Cloudflare Pages Functions
- Storage: KV + R2

## Desarrollo local
```bash
npm install
npm run dev# ==== ESTRUCTURA DE CARPETAS ====
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path "public","public\css","public\js","public\icons","public\images\games","functions","functions\api","functions\api\captures","functions\api\admin","data",".github\workflows" | Out-Null

# ==== .gitignore ====
@'
node_modules/
.env
.env.local
.wrangler/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
